// SFX — Player leave (roster loses a player)
// Status: DONE (owner-approved 2026-07-19)
// The mirror of sfx-player-join: falling C5 -> F4, darker (lpf 1600) and quieter.
// A soft goodbye, not a sad trombone.
// Render: one hit, WAV. Audition plays once per second.
// Paste into https://strudel.cc — spec: TDD/sound/stinger-sfx-spec.md

setcpm(60)

note("[c5 f4@2] ~ ~ ~").sound("gm_epiano1")
  .attack(.005).decay(.22).sustain(0).release(.12)
  .lpf(1600).room(.12).size(2)
  .gain(.32)
